      "statusChangeNewStatus": "tracked",
      "value": "Can you provide a few use-cases for needing more than 5 layers of moderation hierarchy?\n\nDoes this change with the recent inclusion of the Everyone Role, which should you want to, now allows you to set \"View All Members\" as a global default permission without incurring the management role limit?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
