      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5eff476248ee5765bbf3f17a|full_name} Thank you, that's very useful information, and that matches use cases I've seen in larger groups.\n\nSwitching the logic to exclude the owner role from the count would be doable, and I think a reasonably easy sell, but I'll ensure the ask to raise the cap to 10 is seriously considered.",
