      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As more features have rolled out for groups, worlds, and now there's a calendar, even more permissions now give a role \"management\" level access. I'm a part of Trans Academy (TRANS.7885) which has nearly 100 volunteers and our hierarchal structure means that certain roles need to have very specific permissions. When those permissions are locked behind a \"Management\" status, it makes it impossible for all roles to get the permissions they need. Ideally it should be 10, or more.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
