  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We can create up to 50 Group roles but only 5 of those can be management roles, and one of those is a Group Owner role, so in reality we can only have 4 Management roles.\n\nThis is not even nearly enough, considering the fact that the role becomes a \"Management\" role as soon as it has for example View All members during normal use you run out very quickly.\n\nI believe the amount of Management roles should be increased to at least 10. This allows us to have 9 different management roles, so we can properly choose which permissions we want to give which role.",
